<div id="0484af4e"><div class="re7lhSNl15rHkStNWfpr _DmNksM03MW0imTZ92Zj"><div class="fPnbW2LIDDXkLu7Sd2DI"><ul class="qKN9QYrNs0tc2hac6kse"><li><ul class="jtkkgzPbbPs4wbvpUNch Q2QchAPLIgi9KO9i4PnS"><li class="ybbVqLS47JjhpbRWgQDU"><div class="scB0V2YOXdrvrz_31_Sh UmvrEMqsi3eWsu4AYzIA TlIPHGWdLjpQ9IQms3CI KfU6iJxklWZbYVZvHgox VC_CHutChDPYnxQJpTef IZTOdolcpgFPp5vAIVSf" role="none"><div class="TYcoq9Rh8z7xyECZudNA LJogGaMDWMkAWNeNWLSA la0uKOQNZdLd8OUc_QfI"><h2 class="ZiduBuPrxHXQhabvP6SQ">Oslo</h2><div class="BrxHX8d3IdyRW2EN5wWq">Kristiania er plassert på flere steder midt i Oslo sentrum. Her har du alt du trenger for en vellykket studietid.</div><a href="/studere-hos-oss/campus/oslo/" title="Gå til Oslo" class="XezMfDvRba8HKhHr79wm B5Z4_vbRcPt248iwmQXi gYkAa9g2NSCw73nq6w8P" data-owned=""><div class="DdPYOTimBd1c8zDeoFgi"><span class="visuallyHidden">Gå til Oslo</span><span class="SvgIcon ZZTVQHAQYCpOyObqO2AO"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-arrow-right-circle"></use></svg></span></div></a></div></div></li><li class="ybbVqLS47JjhpbRWgQDU"><div class="scB0V2YOXdrvrz_31_Sh UmvrEMqsi3eWsu4AYzIA TlIPHGWdLjpQ9IQms3CI KfU6iJxklWZbYVZvHgox VC_CHutChDPYnxQJpTef IZTOdolcpgFPp5vAIVSf" role="none"><div class="TYcoq9Rh8z7xyECZudNA LJogGaMDWMkAWNeNWLSA la0uKOQNZdLd8OUc_QfI"><h2 class="ZiduBuPrxHXQhabvP6SQ">Bergen</h2><div class="BrxHX8d3IdyRW2EN5wWq">Bergen skiller seg fra andre studentbyer med sitt sentrumsnære studentmiljø, noe som har formet byen mellom de syv fjell.</div><a href="/studere-hos-oss/campus/bergen/" title="Gå til Bergen" class="XezMfDvRba8HKhHr79wm B5Z4_vbRcPt248iwmQXi gYkAa9g2NSCw73nq6w8P" data-owned=""><div class="DdPYOTimBd1c8zDeoFgi"><span class="visuallyHidden">Gå til Bergen</span><span class="SvgIcon ZZTVQHAQYCpOyObqO2AO"><svg><use xlink:href="/dist/iconsSprite.ff403ecca.svg#sprite-arrow-right-circle"></use></svg></span></div></a></div></div></li><li class="ybbVqLS47JjhpbRWgQDU"><div class="scB0V2YOXdrvrz_31_Sh UmvrEMqsi3eWsu4AY